  "title": "Broad CVDI Human Disease Portal",
  "bodyHtml": "<p>This website hosts rare coding variant gene-level associations for 601 diseases across 604,179 individuals, from the submitted manuscript:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rare genetic variants underlying human diseases across biobanks and ancestries.<br />\r\nJurgens SJ, Wang X, <i>et al</i>.<br />\r\nSubmitted for publication, 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>To find genes associated with a phenotype:</strong><!--PMID: <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30239796/\" target=\"_blank\"> 30239796 </a>--></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Browse&nbsp;the <a href=\"/research.html?pageid=600_diseases_phenotypes\" target=\"_blank\">Phenotype list</a> to find a phenotype of interest</li>\r\n\t<li>Click on its phecode to open a search for that phenotype</li>\r\n\t<li>Example result: <a href=\"/research.html?pageid=600_diseases_phenotype&amp;ancestry=Mixed&amp;phecode=phecode_427.2\" target=\"_blank\">Atrial fibrillation and flutter</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>To find phenotype associations for a gene:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Enter a gene name into the <a href=\"/research.html?pageid=600_diseases_gene\" target=\"_blank\">Gene search</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li>Example result: <a href=\"/research.html?pageid=600_diseases_gene&amp;gene=PKD1&amp;ancestry=Mixed\" target=\"_blank\"><em>PKD1</em></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
